  "@type": "DefinedTerm",
  "alternateName": "Macrofaunal communities species composition and relative abundance not affected adversely by nutrient and organic enrichment",
  "description": "The species composition and relative abundance of macrofaunal communities, achieve values that indicate that there is no adverse effect due to nutrient and organic enrichment, as follows: (a) in coastal waters, the values for benthic biological quality elements set in accordance with Directive 2000/60/EC; (b) beyond coastal waters, values consistent with those for coastal waters under Directive 2000/60/EC. Member States shall establish those values through regional or subregional cooperation.",
